  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program development funds 2018 - Land security study</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programutvecklingsmedel 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden har behov av att kunna finansiera mindre bist&#xe5;ndsrelaterade aktiviteter vilka faller utanf&#xf6;r de direkta insatserna men som bed&#xf6;ms vara relevanta och strategiska f&#xf6;r utvecklingssamarbetet i Mali. Det kan t.ex. vara upphandling av f&#xf6;rberedande studier, konsultinsatser f&#xf6;r att utveckla besluts- och finansieringsunderlag, extra revisioner, &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningar, lokala seminarier eller liknande. Medel har avsatts f&#xf6;r detta under tidigare &#xe5;r och det bed&#xf6;ms angel&#xe4;get att fortsatt ha tillg&#xe5;ng till dylik finansiering. Sidas riktlinjer avseende villkor f&#xf6;r viss finansiering via sakanslag ska till&#xe4;mpas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy has identified a need to finance short term activities in relation to the Swedish funded development cooperation programmes in Mali, such as, procurement of preparatory studies, development of underlying documents, extra audits, translation of documents and local seminars and events. These activities fall outside of direct contributions, but are still deemed to be important and strategic for the overall development cooperation with Mali. As in previous years, it is proposed that such activities are covered by a Programme Development Fund. Sida&#x2019;s Guidelines on conditions for using the operational appropriation will be applied.</narrative>
  </description>
